IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. TABLES.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-NUMS    PIC 9(4) OCCURS 5 TIMES.
01 WS-PRICES  PIC 9(5)V99 OCCURS 3 TIMES.
01 WS-I       PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
01 WS-TOTAL   PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-MAX     PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    PERFORM FILL-NUMS VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 5.
    PERFORM SHOW-NUMS VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 5.

    MOVE 10.50 TO WS-PRICES(1).
    MOVE 20.25 TO WS-PRICES(2).
    MOVE 5.00  TO WS-PRICES(3).
    PERFORM SUM-PRICES VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 3.
    DISPLAY "Total prices: " WS-TOTAL.

    PERFORM FIND-MAX VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 5.
    DISPLAY "Max: " WS-MAX.
    STOP RUN.

FILL-NUMS.
    COMPUTE WS-NUMS(WS-I) = WS-I * WS-I.

SHOW-NUMS.
    DISPLAY "n(" WS-I ") = " WS-NUMS(WS-I).

SUM-PRICES.
    ADD WS-PRICES(WS-I) TO WS-TOTAL.

FIND-MAX.
    IF WS-NUMS(WS-I) > WS-MAX THEN
        MOVE WS-NUMS(WS-I) TO WS-MAX
    END-IF.
